(5731531, 833536, 24983, '<td valign="top">yup this meets all criteria for me excellent work  10</td>', 'yup this meets all criteria for me excellent work  10', '2009-11-18 01:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731552, 833829, 56579, '<td valign="top">Out of focus decreases what otherwise could have been a much better photo.  Also the mergers with the arms of the two people on the side look unintentional.</td>', 'Out of focus decreases what otherwise could have been a much better photo.  Also the mergers with the arms of the two people on the side look unintentional.', '2009-11-18 01:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731563, 834265, 56579, '<td valign="top">Biggest complaint with this photo personally is the white balance.  It looks like it should be on a white background, it may not have been.  I would put it on a rich colour like a blue, or purple to contrast the medals.</td>', 'Biggest complaint with this photo personally is the white balance.  It looks like it should be on a white background, it may not have been.  I would put it on a rich colour like a blue, or purple to contrast the medals.', '2009-11-18 01:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731594, 834016, 47541, '<td valign="top">No idea what country this is supposed to be - Italy, Brazil, any other overly christian place. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'No idea what country this is supposed to be - Italy, Brazil, any other overly christian place. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731595, 834124, 47541, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how the rear end of four women captures the spirit of India? If we could see one of them from the front to see her doing whatever she is doing then maybe. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'I''m not sure how the rear end of four women captures the spirit of India? If we could see one of them from the front to see her doing whatever she is doing then maybe. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731596, 834037, 47541, '<td valign="top">Does an Alligator capture the spirit of the Americas? The USA I presume but that''s not obvious. If it is the USA then I associate Alligators with Florida rather than the whole country. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'Does an Alligator capture the spirit of the Americas? The USA I presume but that''s not obvious. If it is the USA then I associate Alligators with Florida rather than the whole country. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731597, 834053, 47541, '<td valign="top">Interesting take. Does the Beehive show the spirit of NZ. I''m not convinced but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Interesting take. Does the Beehive show the spirit of NZ. I''m not convinced but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2009-11-18 01:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731598, 833935, 43400, '<td valign="top">Great composition, sky and the iconic E Tower. This says it all. A "nine".</td>', 'Great composition, sky and the iconic E Tower. This says it all. A "nine".', '2009-11-18 01:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731599, 834072, 47541, '<td valign="top">The idea is great. The ANZAC spirit is something that does helf define Aussie. The image seems to have competing focal points however.</td>', 'The idea is great. The ANZAC spirit is something that does helf define Aussie. The image seems to have competing focal points however.', '2009-11-18 01:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731600, 833120, 47541, '<td valign="top">So death shows the spirit of the USA? Maybe you have to be American to understand that. I also don''t understand the title - wings of what? Sorry, DNMC IMO</td>', 'So death shows the spirit of the USA? Maybe you have to be American to understand that. I also don''t understand the title - wings of what? Sorry, DNMC IMO', '2009-11-18 01:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731602, 834045, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good capture of ferris wheel, but I think this can be anywhere.--any country. If the lighting was red, white &amp; blue--it would give it more strength.</td>', 'Good capture of ferris wheel, but I think this can be anywhere.--any country. If the lighting was red, white & blue--it would give it more strength.', '2009-11-18 01:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731604, 834150, 47541, '<td valign="top">The Olympic spirit may be strong in Canada but does it define the country? I think not. The shot also screams snapshot. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'The Olympic spirit may be strong in Canada but does it define the country? I think not. The shot also screams snapshot. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731605, 833991, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and message.</td>', 'I like the composition and message.', '2009-11-18 01:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731607, 833262, 47541, '<td valign="top">The flags are the only clue to the country being referenced. I also wonder how death is the spirit of the USA? This does say something about Americans if this is true. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'The flags are the only clue to the country being referenced. I also wonder how death is the spirit of the USA? This does say something about Americans if this is true. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731611, 834049, 47541, '<td valign="top">Which country? Oh, if I look close I can see these are US dollars. SO the spirit of the USA is greedy capitialism is it? I''m not convinced. The shot lacks definition. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'Which country? Oh, if I look close I can see these are US dollars. SO the spirit of the USA is greedy capitialism is it? I''m not convinced. The shot lacks definition. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731612, 834139, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good subject, but I would have zoomed in a bit more and make it a bit sharper. Not sure what country it represents, somewhere in Europe?</td>', 'Good subject, but I would have zoomed in a bit more and make it a bit sharper. Not sure what country it represents, somewhere in Europe?', '2009-11-18 01:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731613, 833850, 47541, '<td valign="top">A fantastic shot and it captures many aspects that we associate with Russia: the dolls, youth, and a certain sadness that we glimpse in her eyes. Well done.</td>', 'A fantastic shot and it captures many aspects that we associate with Russia: the dolls, youth, and a certain sadness that we glimpse in her eyes. Well done.', '2009-11-18 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731615, 833898, 47541, '<td valign="top">The Statue of Liberty certainly does represent the USA. Centered composition doesn''t work well with the boat in the shot.</td>', 'The Statue of Liberty certainly does represent the USA. Centered composition doesn''t work well with the boat in the shot.', '2009-11-18 01:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731616, 834175, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color palette</td>', 'I like the composition and color palette', '2009-11-18 01:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731618, 834219, 47541, '<td valign="top">I like the shot. The hint of movement works. The B&amp;W is perfect. The country is a mystery as there are Starbucks in almost every country in the world now. Sorry, slightly DNMC IMO.</td>', 'I like the shot. The hint of movement works. The B&W is perfect. The country is a mystery as there are Starbucks in almost every country in the world now. Sorry, slightly DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731619, 834017, 47541, '<td valign="top">Great representation of one the USA''s most famous sports. The composition doesn''t work that well for me - maybe less of the reflection to focus on ball more.</td>', 'Great representation of one the USA''s most famous sports. The composition doesn''t work that well for me - maybe less of the reflection to focus on ball more.', '2009-11-18 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731622, 833898, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good subject and B&amp;W selection. I think this could be better composed without having the S-of-L on top of the cruise boat. But good overall.</td>', 'Good subject and B&W selection. I think this could be better composed without having the S-of-L on top of the cruise boat. But good overall.', '2009-11-18 02:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731624, 834110, 47541, '<td valign="top">How does this show the spirit of a country. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'How does this show the spirit of a country. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731626, 834175, 47541, '<td valign="top">Yep, wine surely is one of the key elements of Italy. Great use of a lensbaby.</td>', 'Yep, wine surely is one of the key elements of Italy. Great use of a lensbaby.', '2009-11-18 02:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731628, 834219, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition, but I think that even though SBs started in America, it''s now world-wide and probably not a strong enough "spirit" anymore--I could be wrong.</td>', 'Good subject and composition, but I think that even though SBs started in America, it''s now world-wide and probably not a strong enough "spirit" anymore--I could be wrong.', '2009-11-18 02:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731629, 834247, 47541, '<td valign="top">Another military photo for the USA - you guys sure are a warmongering lot aren''t you? At least this one has living people in it. Nicely composed but the fact they are all looking away from us doesn;t help us engage with them.</td>', 'Another military photo for the USA - you guys sure are a warmongering lot aren''t you? At least this one has living people in it. Nicely composed but the fact they are all looking away from us doesn;t help us engage with them.', '2009-11-18 02:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731631, 834288, 43400, '<td valign="top">NICE. Simple composition, very symbolic of the country. Great lighting!</td>', 'NICE. Simple composition, very symbolic of the country. Great lighting!', '2009-11-18 02:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731632, 834258, 47541, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. The USA is well known for it''s passion about sports and gridiron in particular. Nicely composed and processed.</td>', 'Fantastic shot. The USA is well known for it''s passion about sports and gridiron in particular. Nicely composed and processed.', '2009-11-18 02:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731634, 833574, 47541, '<td valign="top">Almost perfect. Composition is slightly off what I''d prefer but I suspect that if he was left more I''d complain about the negative space. Captures the spirit of the USA in a great way - reminding us of the pre-European roots and the spirit that has all but been destroyed, not only in the USA but in many other countries around the world. His expression seems to show that burden and you can almost hear him thinking of how his ancestors would feel if they could see what has become of their treasured lands.</td>', 'Almost perfect. Composition is slightly off what I''d prefer but I suspect that if he was left more I''d complain about the negative space. Captures the spirit of the USA in a great way - reminding us of the pre-European roots and the spirit that has all but been destroyed, not only in the USA but in many other countries around the world. His expression seems to show that burden and you can almost hear him thinking of how his ancestors would feel if they could see what has become of their treasured lands.', '2009-11-18 02:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731636, 834005, 47541, '<td valign="top">Ummm, folded washing? A dead soldiers clothes? I fail to get the message on what the spirit is. The JFK quote doesn''t guide me either. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'Ummm, folded washing? A dead soldiers clothes? I fail to get the message on what the spirit is. The JFK quote doesn''t guide me either. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731637, 833667, 47541, '<td valign="top">The processing is great, except for the frame, it''s a bit too big for my liking. Does this capture the spirit of the USA? Nope, what are you trying to show? Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'The processing is great, except for the frame, it''s a bit too big for my liking. Does this capture the spirit of the USA? Nope, what are you trying to show? Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731638, 833262, 43400, '<td valign="top">Great image and composition. My 1st impression was the first gravestone with an italian name that cause a little confusion, but the US flags cleared things up. The image quality could be a little sharper/clearer</td>', 'Great image and composition. My 1st impression was the first gravestone with an italian name that cause a little confusion, but the US flags cleared things up. The image quality could be a little sharper/clearer', '2009-11-18 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731639, 834286, 47541, '<td valign="top">I get the idea you were going for but I don''t feel that it has come off. The "wild" is not apparent in the shot. I also wonder why B&amp;W?</td>', 'I get the idea you were going for but I don''t feel that it has come off. The "wild" is not apparent in the shot. I also wonder why B&W?', '2009-11-18 02:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731640, 833684, 47541, '<td valign="top">So a streetlamp is the spirit of Italy? Oh wait, there''s a christian cross in the background. OK, so it''s not a strong conveyance of the message but it''s there. Great tones.</td>', 'So a streetlamp is the spirit of Italy? Oh wait, there''s a christian cross in the background. OK, so it''s not a strong conveyance of the message but it''s there. Great tones.', '2009-11-18 02:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731642, 833986, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Hate the border. Good composition. What country? A leaf represents the spirit of where? Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'Nice shot. Hate the border. Good composition. What country? A leaf represents the spirit of where? Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731643, 833684, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouette composition, however, if it wasn''t for the title, iwould think this would be somewhere in the US or Mexico. Great sky and tilt add some interests as well.</td>', 'I like the silhouette composition, however, if it wasn''t for the title, iwould think this would be somewhere in the US or Mexico. Great sky and tilt add some interests as well.', '2009-11-18 02:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731644, 833385, 47541, '<td valign="top">A statement as well as meeting the challenge huh? I''m not sure that "debasing a cultural item" is the spirit of NZ really. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and assume you mean the Maori culture is the spirit.</td>', 'A statement as well as meeting the challenge huh? I''m not sure that "debasing a cultural item" is the spirit of NZ really. I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and assume you mean the Maori culture is the spirit.', '2009-11-18 02:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731646, 834139, 47541, '<td valign="top">I can not determine the country being referenced here. Sorry, DNMC IMO.</td>', 'I can not determine the country being referenced here. Sorry, DNMC IMO.', '2009-11-18 02:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731648, 833991, 47541, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot. Composition could be better. The spirit of the USA is tough girls is it? I can''t buy that.</td>', 'Not a bad shot. Composition could be better. The spirit of the USA is tough girls is it? I can''t buy that.', '2009-11-18 02:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731649, 834204, 43400, '<td valign="top">Looks delicious and well captured, but I''m not sure <br/>what country it''s from. I haven''t traveled much.</td>', 'Looks delicious and well captured, but I''m not sure what country it''s from. I haven''t traveled much.', '2009-11-18 02:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
