(5731690, 833728, 47541, '<td valign="top">Garish and over processed but this does show the spirit of many Asian countries well. We see the youth with the attitude of rebellion and excess that the processing implies. Her expression is wonderful as it shows a mix of confidence and apprehension at the same time. Great work.</td>', 'Garish and over processed but this does show the spirit of many Asian countries well. We see the youth with the attitude of rebellion and excess that the processing implies. Her expression is wonderful as it shows a mix of confidence and apprehension at the same time. Great work.', '2009-11-18 02:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731692, 834086, 47541, '<td valign="top">This made me smile. This does capture the spirit of the country well, even if it isn''t in the spirit of the challenge! Nice.</td>', 'This made me smile. This does capture the spirit of the country well, even if it isn''t in the spirit of the challenge! Nice.', '2009-11-18 02:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731694, 834288, 47541, '<td valign="top">I want to love this shot but I can only get to liking it. I so want to see the bird better and the horizon is all wonky - can''t do much about that in the desert can you? Good work.</td>', 'I want to love this shot but I can only get to liking it. I so want to see the bird better and the horizon is all wonky - can''t do much about that in the desert can you? Good work.', '2009-11-18 02:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731695, 834207, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice. This captures the English countryside well. I can see how the spirit of England is the farming that formed the backbone of the country for so many years. The greens feel a bit too vibrant.</td>', 'Nice. This captures the English countryside well. I can see how the spirit of England is the farming that formed the backbone of the country for so many years. The greens feel a bit too vibrant.', '2009-11-18 03:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
