(5731711, 834186, 47541, '<td valign="top">Big Ben sure is something that we identify with England but does it define the spirit? I think so, it''s been a cornerstone of England for many years, something the English rely on in a history that has been full of upheaval. Well done.</td>', 'Big Ben sure is something that we identify with England but does it define the spirit? I think so, it''s been a cornerstone of England for many years, something the English rely on in a history that has been full of upheaval. Well done.', '2009-11-18 03:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
