(5731713, 834239, 47541, '<td valign="top">The title is so critical here that I can''t go past it. The flag is backwards - flip the shot perhaps? This is also going to be DQ''d for the selective desat.</td>', 'The title is so critical here that I can''t go past it. The flag is backwards - flip the shot perhaps? This is also going to be DQ''d for the selective desat.', '2009-11-18 03:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
