(5731784, 834188, 99263, '<td valign="top">This lovely image brings back memories to me. Back in 1973 when I was 20 I hitchhiked into Lesotho from South Africa and spent about 6 months in the country. Spent a while living with students at Roma university and also lived for a while with some Canadian folks I met who were teaching the Bahai faith in Teyateyaneng and operated a rock crushing machine there. Even spent a week in a flea invested jail cell in Maseru for some disturbance I had caused at the Holiday Inn in town one evening whilst drunk and high on marijuana.</td>', 'This lovely image brings back memories to me. Back in 1973 when I was 20 I hitchhiked into Lesotho from South Africa and spent about 6 months in the country. Spent a while living with students at Roma university and also lived for a while with some Canadian folks I met who were teaching the Bahai faith in Teyateyaneng and operated a rock crushing machine there. Even spent a week in a flea invested jail cell in Maseru for some disturbance I had caused at the Holiday Inn in town one evening whilst drunk and high on marijuana.', '2009-11-18 04:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5731818, 833935, 75618, '<td valign="top">Cliche but still great! 7</td>', 'Cliche but still great! 7', '2009-11-18 05:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
