(5731822, 834239, 75618, '<td valign="top">Not too sure if the selective desaturation enhances the image.  The editing''s also a little sloppy, I can see halos around the flag and the tree.  However, I like the symbolisms here so its still strong enough to get a 6 from me.</td>', 'Not too sure if the selective desaturation enhances the image.  The editing''s also a little sloppy, I can see halos around the flag and the tree.  However, I like the symbolisms here so its still strong enough to get a 6 from me.', '2009-11-18 05:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
