(5732718, 833986, 43774, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo but the challenge asked for the non-stereotypical photo to represent a country. A red maple leaf is about as stereotypical and cliched as it comes when referring to Canada. Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'This is a lovely photo but the challenge asked for the non-stereotypical photo to represent a country. A red maple leaf is about as stereotypical and cliched as it comes when referring to Canada. Good luck in the challenge!', '2009-11-18 17:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
