(5735464, 833850, 108982, '<td valign="top">excellent photo, love B&amp;W''s and this is no exception.  The little girl is so classically Russian in appearance it adds a nostalgic feel to the photo.  good lighting.  I would have gone even higher with a little shallower DOF.  Nice 7</td>', 'excellent photo, love B&W''s and this is no exception.  The little girl is so classically Russian in appearance it adds a nostalgic feel to the photo.  good lighting.  I would have gone even higher with a little shallower DOF.  Nice 7', '2009-11-20 23:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
