(5737582, 834264, 89230, '<td valign="top">Well done. I like this photo because, 1. the blue color, 2, the swirls in the glass, 3, the ice adds a nice touch. Next time, however, I would like to see the complete reflection. I think becuase that is missing that this photo couldve been so much better. Either way, its my favorite + highest rated of the challenge. 9. Good job!</td>', 'Well done. I like this photo because, 1. the blue color, 2, the swirls in the glass, 3, the ice adds a nice touch. Next time, however, I would like to see the complete reflection. I think becuase that is missing that this photo couldve been so much better. Either way, its my favorite + highest rated of the challenge. 9. Good job!', '2009-11-23 01:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737583, 833991, 89230, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression on her face. Im not sure if you just found this photo and matched a title to meet the challenge, but the title really does it for me. This is a great photo. I think maybe next time a little tighter crop on the left? This was one of my top favorites of the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the expression on her face. Im not sure if you just found this photo and matched a title to meet the challenge, but the title really does it for me. This is a great photo. I think maybe next time a little tighter crop on the left? This was one of my top favorites of the challenge.', '2009-11-23 01:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737585, 834017, 89230, '<td valign="top">I like this idea. You chose a baseball that was worn, which shows a lot more character than a new baseball and that is great. The only thing that seperates this from a #1 ranked photo, in my opinion, is the lighting/white balance. While I am sure the ball isnt completely white, I feel it couldve been closer to actual white and maybe brightened it up a bit, if possible. I like how you captured the full reflection, and didnt cut it off. Well done! Hopefully we''ll see this on the front page!</td>', 'I like this idea. You chose a baseball that was worn, which shows a lot more character than a new baseball and that is great. The only thing that seperates this from a #1 ranked photo, in my opinion, is the lighting/white balance. While I am sure the ball isnt completely white, I feel it couldve been closer to actual white and maybe brightened it up a bit, if possible. I like how you captured the full reflection, and didnt cut it off. Well done! Hopefully we''ll see this on the front page!', '2009-11-23 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737588, 834258, 89230, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! I like his expression, and how you were able to capture the light rays from the sun!</td>', 'What a great idea! I like his expression, and how you were able to capture the light rays from the sun!', '2009-11-23 01:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
