(5739222, 833829, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. It''s zoomed-in so it lost some good focus quality.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. It''s zoomed-in so it lost some good focus quality.', '2009-11-24 06:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739224, 834240, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and color, but not sure it represents a country''s spirit.</td>', 'I like the composition and color, but not sure it represents a country''s spirit.', '2009-11-24 06:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739228, 834186, 43400, '<td valign="top">Definitely a country''s spirit, but seems to lack something to make this image more interesting--probably the composition but not sure.</td>', 'Definitely a country''s spirit, but seems to lack something to make this image more interesting--probably the composition but not sure.', '2009-11-24 06:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739229, 833728, 43400, '<td valign="top">Interesing mannequin.</td>', 'Interesing mannequin.', '2009-11-24 06:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739232, 834271, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good capture and spirited</td>', 'Good capture and spirited', '2009-11-24 06:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739234, 834278, 43400, '<td valign="top">The colors and sky are fantastic. I would have cropped some of the sky (horizontally) on the top to focus more on the cementary. Great colors.</td>', 'The colors and sky are fantastic. I would have cropped some of the sky (horizontally) on the top to focus more on the cementary. Great colors.', '2009-11-24 06:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739235, 834268, 43400, '<td valign="top">Great detail, colors and composition and definitely symbolizes the US.</td>', 'Great detail, colors and composition and definitely symbolizes the US.', '2009-11-24 06:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739236, 834286, 43400, '<td valign="top">Nice in B&amp;W. I would have contrasted just a little.</td>', 'Nice in B&W. I would have contrasted just a little.', '2009-11-24 07:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739239, 834285, 43400, '<td valign="top">Good tones, lighting and composition--has a strong Ad feel. Fireplace in background truly helps this image.</td>', 'Good tones, lighting and composition--has a strong Ad feel. Fireplace in background truly helps this image.', '2009-11-24 07:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739242, 834085, 43400, '<td valign="top">I like the color huesand sun light, not sure if the solar glare helps or hurts the image.</td>', 'I like the color huesand sun light, not sure if the solar glare helps or hurts the image.', '2009-11-24 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739243, 834251, 43400, '<td valign="top">Interesting in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Interesting in B&W.', '2009-11-24 07:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739244, 834110, 43400, '<td valign="top">Great colors and exposure.</td>', 'Great colors and exposure.', '2009-11-24 07:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739585, 833850, 3818, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the group! A wonderful capture beautifully presented that perfectly fits the spirit of the challenge. Well done~</td>', 'This is my favorite of the group! A wonderful capture beautifully presented that perfectly fits the spirit of the challenge. Well done~', '2009-11-24 11:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739587, 833817, 3818, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured at just the right moment. Great image of a different culture.</td>', 'Nicely captured at just the right moment. Great image of a different culture.', '2009-11-24 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740417, 834086, 81530, '<td valign="top"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=99710" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">denbote</a>?</td>', ' denbote?', '2009-11-24 20:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740435, 834017, 111625, '<td valign="top">exactly</td>', 'exactly', '2009-11-24 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740587, 833935, 69246, '<td valign="top">Iconic in itself, photographs of the Eiffel tower are done so often that they often become cliché. However, this is not the case with this photograph. The symmetry, texture with the clouds, and perfect use of the zone system not only makes this photograph stand out from the rest (well outside of DPC) but also tops this as my highest vote in this challenge. Nicely done!</td>', 'Iconic in itself, photographs of the Eiffel tower are done so often that they often become cliché. However, this is not the case with this photograph. The symmetry, texture with the clouds, and perfect use of the zone system not only makes this photograph stand out from the rest (well outside of DPC) but also tops this as my highest vote in this challenge. Nicely done!', '2009-11-24 22:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740644, 834037, 60698, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and details. He looks like he is smiling! :) You can see his tongue and all of his nice white teeth! Well done! :)</td>', 'Nice tones and details. He looks like he is smiling! :) You can see his tongue and all of his nice white teeth! Well done! :)', '2009-11-24 23:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
