(5741464, 834288, 28322, '<td valign="top">Hi Alfredo, congratulation on the very well deserved ribbon, <br/>I could tell he is not Arab by the way he is adjusting the head ware, do you know there are many ways to adjust it?!!<br/>The color of the '''' Ghotra '''' changes from a country to another, the way and dare I say style varies from a generation to another. You can even in some countries differentiate between different families from the way they do it :) <br/> <br/>I like the strobing in here, I am not sure if you saw David Hobby''s shooting in Dubai, it is very similar. <br/>Very well done and congratulation my friend. <br/> <br/>P.S, Please ask Mr. Damin where is the white trousers that usually goes under? º <br/></td>', 'Hi Alfredo, congratulation on the very well deserved ribbon, I could tell he is not Arab by the way he is adjusting the head ware, do you know there are many ways to adjust it?!!The color of the '''' Ghotra '''' changes from a country to another, the way and dare I say style varies from a generation to another. You can even in some countries differentiate between different families from the way they do it :)  I like the strobing in here, I am not sure if you saw David Hobby''s shooting in Dubai, it is very similar. Very well done and congratulation my friend.  P.S, Please ask Mr. Damin where is the white trousers that usually goes under? º ', '2009-11-25 11:57:20.000000', NULL, 0),
