(5742098, 833986, 10275, '<td valign="top">I love this image. It definitely symbolizes Canada to me. When I was in Europe and walked the streets of different cities during this fall, a single red maple leaf on the ground would always make me think of my home - Canada. Many Canadians would agree that image like this has a meaning to us.</td>', 'I love this image. It definitely symbolizes Canada to me. When I was in Europe and walked the streets of different cities during this fall, a single red maple leaf on the ground would always make me think of my home - Canada. Many Canadians would agree that image like this has a meaning to us.', '2009-11-25 20:07:36.000000', NULL, 0),
