(5742255, 833935, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh, Deb. Congratulations on a fine image and a SUPER placement.<br/> <br/>Yes, I''ve see this icon a number of times, each time gaining more from the experience.  Once I just sat in the Bateau (the one that goes up and down the Seine &amp; hits the high spots) and drew the thing.  I finished its left leg before we had to leave again.  It''s a high point in my sketchbook of that trip.  <br/> <br/>Thanks for bringing back that fond memory and for making such a great image.<br/> <br/>:-))</td>', 'Oh, Deb. Congratulations on a fine image and a SUPER placement. Yes, I''ve see this icon a number of times, each time gaining more from the experience.  Once I just sat in the Bateau (the one that goes up and down the Seine & hits the high spots) and drew the thing.  I finished its left leg before we had to leave again.  It''s a high point in my sketchbook of that trip.   Thanks for bringing back that fond memory and for making such a great image. :-))', '2009-11-25 21:26:51.000000', NULL, 0),
