(5742755, 833536, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like this one.  It''s busy (which we know I like) and it tells a lot more of the story than mine does, for instance.  You caught most of that in your title, but it really is quite the fun shot to wander about in!  (You even got a bus with Trafalgar Square, and a tourist, since most native Brits don''t carry Union Jack brollys.)</td>', 'I like this one.  It''s busy (which we know I like) and it tells a lot more of the story than mine does, for instance.  You caught most of that in your title, but it really is quite the fun shot to wander about in!  (You even got a bus with Trafalgar Square, and a tourist, since most native Brits don''t carry Union Jack brollys.)', '2009-11-26 11:24:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5742756, 834059, 30982, '<td valign="top">What GORGEOUS fabric!  That''s one of those things that can never photograph as well as it looks in person - not your fault, just the way it is.  Still it really shows off well all the fine detail and elaborate design - definitely keeping in the spirit of the country of Japan.</td>', 'What GORGEOUS fabric!  That''s one of those things that can never photograph as well as it looks in person - not your fault, just the way it is.  Still it really shows off well all the fine detail and elaborate design - definitely keeping in the spirit of the country of Japan.', '2009-11-26 11:26:23.000000', NULL, 0),
